    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦσιγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγγος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blister</i> on the heel caused by a burn, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.198
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stalk of garlic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fist.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.4.12
			</span></i>; or (acc. to Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				525
			</span></i>) <i>the outer coat of a clove of garlic.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a particular kind af garlic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				120
			</span></i>.</div>
